%% Add an expense, with live updates and a budget alert. Claude rewrites this via /update-diagrams.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Family member
  participant W as Web app
  participant A as API (ExpenseService)
  participant D as SQLite
  participant H as SignalR hub
  participant O as Other open tabs

  U->>W: save the expense form
  W->>A: POST /api/v1/expenses
  Note over A: check permission expense.add,<br/>validate contract and domain rules
  A->>D: insert the expense (GUID v7 id)
  A->>D: sum this month's spending in the category
  A->>H: expenses changed
  H-->>O: change notice, so cached queries refresh
  opt the category just went over budget
    A->>H: budget exceeded
    H-->>W: alert toast
    H-->>O: alert toast
  end
  A-->>W: 201 Created
